      <title>Claremont school district questions legality of budget cap petition</title>
      <link>https://www.nhpr.org/nh-news/2026-02-23/claremont-school-district-questions-legality-budget-cap-petition-nh</link>
      <description>In Claremont, NH, a petition article asks voters to implement a budget cap by requiring the School Board to submit a budget (for 2027-28) that is not higher than the 2025-26 per pupil cost times the average daily enrollment plus the annual inflation increase for the Boston region.</description>
